  "description": "Voodoo Bizango\n\nThe Latest Voodoo Bizango is built for riders who crave performance, control, and confidence on the trails. With a refined frame design, top-tier components, and responsive handling, this hardtail MTB is ready to push your limits.\n\nWhy Choose the Bizango?\n\nDesigned with modern geometry for better control on steep descents. The Suntour Raidon32 air fork delivers a smooth, responsive ride across rough terrain.\n\nBuilt for durability and precision, the 11-50T cassette with LINKGLIDE technology ensures flawless shifting and long-lasting performance.\n\nMaxxis Forekaster tyres provide excellent grip and cornering stability, delivering faster rolling than Minion tyres but with superior braking control.\n\nA WTB Volt saddle, 6061 alloy handlebars, and Voodoo lock-on grips help smooth out vibrations, keeping you in control on any trail.\n\nWhether you're tackling technical trails, pushing for speed on XC rides, or setting out on an all-day adventure, the Voodoo Bizango is built to perform.\n\nThe previous Bizango model won numerous awards for its outstanding specifications and exceptional ride quality. Now, the relaunch of the Bizango takes this legacy even further with entirely new geometry, setting a higher standard!\n\nThe frame has been completely redesigned with a slacker angle, offering improved comfort, greater control, and an even more confident ride on any terrain.",
